    "metin": "I begged ruggedo long ago to send him away but he would not do so.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-135031-0006",
    "metin": "I also offered to help your brother to escape but he would not go.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-135031-0020",
    "metin": "I don't believe ann knew any magic or she'd have worked it before.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0006",
    "metin": "The buzzer's whirr triggered his muscles into complete relaxation.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0019",
    "metin": "There could be little art in this last and final round of fencing.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0032",
    "metin": "Then the powerful twist that thrust it aside in and under the guard.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0011",
    "metin": "The other voice snapped with a harsh urgency clearly used to command.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0015",
    "metin": "There was silence then and still wondering brion was once more asleep.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0003",
    "metin": "His instant of panic was followed by a small sharp blow high on his chest.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-128104-0006",
    "metin": "On the general principles of art mister quilter writes with equal lucidity.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-135031-0003",
    "metin": "The little girl had been asleep but she heard the raps and opened the door.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-135031-0017",
    "metin": "However if we look sharp we may be able to discover one of these secret ways.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0018",
    "metin": "A red haired mountain of a man with an apparently inexhaustible store of energy.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-128104-0010",
    "metin": "Near the fire and the ornaments fred brought home from india on the mantel board.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0005",
    "metin": "A minute is not a very large measure of time and his body needed every fraction of it.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0029",
    "metin": "He thought it was a last burst of energy he knew how close they both were to exhaustion.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   },
   {
    "id": "s-1272-141231-0026",
    "metin": "Breathing deeply brion softly spoke the auto hypnotic phrases that triggered the process.",
    "kaynak": "sentetik"
   }
  ],
